      "writtenOn": "2025-05-15T12:40:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Based on the existing REST api classes naming conventions I think this should rather be named `ListTokens`",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 44,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 44,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "a0c69c6dcc00d0f3495d322fc02802ef75d63c7a",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ae486683_1e243dd7",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/server/restapi/account/GetTokens.java",
        "patchSetId": 25
      },
      "lineNbr": 44,
      "author": {
        "id": 1065256
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-16T10:06:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, not in the accounts REST API, e.g. `GetSshKeys`. There is not a single `List*` class in this package.",
      "parentUuid": "1fb655f7_0e98fab6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 44,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 44,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "a0c69c6dcc00d0f3495d322fc02802ef75d63c7a",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9138fb9d_83268541",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/server/restapi/account/GetTokens.java",
        "patchSetId": 25
      },
      "lineNbr": 44,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002666
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-27T23:23:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Somehow we ended up with the accounts REST API having a different convention :(\n\nThere\u0027s a couple `Get*s` classes outside accounts, but most are `List*`. I vote we start fixing accounts with this change and use `ListTokens` (or if we add the new package, I guess it would be `com.google.gerrit.server.restapi.account.token.List`?).",
      "parentUuid": "ae486683_1e243dd7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 44,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 44,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "a0c69c6dcc00d0f3495d322fc02802ef75d63c7a",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "53bc0e8a_e329fc6d",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/server/restapi/account/GetTokens.java",
        "patchSetId": 25
      },
      "lineNbr": 44,
      "author": {
        "id": 1065256
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-28T14:16:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Similar to my response to your other comment, I would like to stay as consistent as possible within the narrower scope of this new class, but agree that the overall consistency should be fixed. I also believe that although this would be a potentially breaking change, if plugins use those classes, it should be fine to do so on master. I would again be happy to prepare that change.",
      "parentUuid": "9138fb9d_83268541",
